{"seq":1,"slug":"arrays","title":"数组与动态数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-structures/linear-structures/arrays","wordCount":1467,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数组与动态数组\">数组与动态数组</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数组（Array）是最基本的线性数据结构，它将<strong>相同类型</strong>的元素存储在一段<strong>连续的内存空间</strong>中。每个元素通过整数**下标（index）**进行定位，支持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的随机访问。</p>\n<p>理解数组需要抓住四个要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>连续存储</strong> —— 元素在内存中紧邻排列，相邻地址差值恒为单元素大小。</li>\n<li><strong>随机访问</strong> —— 地址可由 <code>基地址 + 下标 × 元素大小</code> 直接算出，故按下标取值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>同质性</strong> —— 所有元素类型一致、占用空间相同，这是&quot;地址可计算&quot;的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>定长与下标从 0 起</strong> —— 长度在创建时确定（静态数组），下标范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, n-1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"block\" data-source=\"block-beta&#10;    columns 8&#10;    block:header:8&#10;        columns 8&#10;        h0[&quot;Index&quot;] h1[&quot;0&quot;] h2[&quot;1&quot;] h3[&quot;2&quot;] h4[&quot;3&quot;] h5[&quot;4&quot;] h6[&quot;5&quot;] h7[&quot;6&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    block:mem:8&#10;        columns 8&#10;        m0[&quot;Addr&quot;] m1[&quot;0x100&quot;] m2[&quot;0x104&quot;] m3[&quot;0x108&quot;] m4[&quot;0x10C&quot;] m5[&quot;0x110&quot;] m6[&quot;0x114&quot;] m7[&quot;0x118&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    block:val:8&#10;        columns 8&#10;        v0[&quot;Val&quot;] v1[&quot;10&quot;] v2[&quot;23&quot;] v3[&quot;5&quot;] v4[&quot;42&quot;] v5[&quot;17&quot;] v6[&quot;8&quot;] v7[&quot;31&quot;]&#10;    end\">block-beta\n    columns 8\n    block:header:8\n        columns 8\n        h0[\"Index\"] h1[\"0\"] h2[\"1\"] h3[\"2\"] h4[\"3\"] h5[\"4\"] h6[\"5\"] h7[\"6\"]\n    end\n    block:mem:8\n        columns 8\n        m0[\"Addr\"] m1[\"0x100\"] m2[\"0x104\"] m3[\"0x108\"] m4[\"0x10C\"] m5[\"0x110\"] m6[\"0x114\"] m7[\"0x118\"]\n    end\n    block:val:8\n        columns 8\n        v0[\"Val\"] v1[\"10\"] v2[\"23\"] v3[\"5\"] v4[\"42\"] v5[\"17\"] v6[\"8\"] v7[\"31\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p>数组在内存中是<strong>连续存储</strong>的，相邻元素的地址差值恰好等于单个元素的大小（如 <code>int</code> 类型为 4 字节）。这就是数组能实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随机访问的根本原因：<code>地址 = 基地址 + 下标 × 元素大小</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>数组（连续）</th>\n<th>链表（非连续）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存布局</td>\n<td>连续，一段整块</td>\n<td>分散，节点由指针连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机访问</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（地址可计算）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（需逐节点跳转）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头部插入/删除</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（需整体搬移）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（改指针即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存友好度</td>\n<td>高（局部性好，预取命中率高）</td>\n<td>低（节点分散，易缓存缺失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额外空间开销</td>\n<td>无（仅元素本身）</td>\n<td>每个节点需存指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：数组&quot;按下标访问快&quot;与&quot;插入删除慢&quot;是同一枚硬币的两面——正因为元素连续、地址可算，随机访问才快；也正因为连续，中间插入必须为腾出空位而搬移其余元素，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"静态数组-vs-动态数组\">静态数组 vs 动态数组</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>静态数组</th>\n<th>动态数组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>创建时固定，不可改变</td>\n<td>可在运行时自动扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分配</td>\n<td>编译期/栈上分配</td>\n<td>运行期/堆上分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>C <code>int a[10]</code>、Java <code>int[]</code></td>\n<td>TypeScript <code>Array</code>、C++ <code>std::vector</code>、Java <code>ArrayList</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可追加元素</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"静态数组\">静态数组</h3><p>静态数组在声明时必须指定大小，之后不能增长或缩小：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const arr: number[] = new Array(5).fill(0); // 长度固定为 5&#10;arr[0] = 10;&#10;arr[1] = 20;&#10;// arr 最多只能存 5 个元素\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 长度固定为 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// arr 最多只能存 5 个元素</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态数组\">动态数组</h3><p>动态数组在逻辑上与静态数组一样按下标访问，但底层会在容量不足时自动<strong>扩容（resize）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const lst: number[] = [];&#10;lst.push(1);&#10;lst.push(2);&#10;lst.push(3);&#10;console.log(lst[0]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(lst[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"核心操作与时间复杂度\">核心操作与时间复杂度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th align=\"center\">静态数组</th>\n<th align=\"center\">动态数组</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按下标访问 <code>arr[i]</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基地址 + 偏移量直接定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按值查找</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最坏需遍历整个数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末尾插入</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>均摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong></td>\n<td>偶尔触发扩容为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，均摊后为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间/头部插入</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需要将后续元素逐一后移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末尾删除</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>直接移除最后一个元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间/头部删除</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需要将后续元素逐一前移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么插入和删除是-o-n\">为什么插入和删除是 O(n)？</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Insert Element 99 at Index 2&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A1[[10, 23, 5, 42, 17]&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;① Shift elements from index 2 rightward&quot;| A2[[10, 23, __, 5, 42, 17]&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt;|&quot;② Write 99 at index 2&quot;| A3[[10, 23, 99, 5, 42, 17]&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Insert Element 99 at Index 2\n        direction TB\n        A1[[10, 23, 5, 42, 17]\"] --&gt;|\"① Shift elements from index 2 rightward\"| A2[[10, 23, __, 5, 42, 17]\"]\n        A2 --&gt;|\"② Write 99 at index 2\"| A3[[10, 23, 99, 5, 42, 17]\"]\n    end</pre><p>在数组中间位置插入一个元素，需要将该位置及之后的所有元素向后移动一格，最坏情况下移动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素，因此时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。删除操作同理，需要将后续元素前移来填补空位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态数组扩容策略与均摊分析\">动态数组扩容策略与均摊分析</h2><p>动态数组的核心设计在于：当内部数组容量不够时，分配一块<strong>更大的新数组</strong>，将旧数据拷贝过去，再释放旧数组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"倍增策略\">倍增策略</h3><p>主流实现通常采用**倍增（doubling）**策略，即每次扩容为原来的 <strong>2 倍</strong>（或 1.5 倍）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    S1[&quot;Cap 4&lt;br/&gt;size 4/4&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;append triggers resize&quot;| S2[&quot;Cap 8&lt;br/&gt;size 5/8&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt;|&quot;continue append...&quot;| S3[&quot;Cap 8&lt;br/&gt;size 8/8&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt;|&quot;append triggers resize&quot;| S4[&quot;Cap 16&lt;br/&gt;size 9/16&quot;]&#10;    S4 --&gt;|&quot;continue append...&quot;| S5[&quot;...&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    S1[\"Cap 4&lt;br/&gt;size 4/4\"] --&gt;|\"append triggers resize\"| S2[\"Cap 8&lt;br/&gt;size 5/8\"]\n    S2 --&gt;|\"continue append...\"| S3[\"Cap 8&lt;br/&gt;size 8/8\"]\n    S3 --&gt;|\"append triggers resize\"| S4[\"Cap 16&lt;br/&gt;size 9/16\"]\n    S4 --&gt;|\"continue append...\"| S5[\"...\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/实现</th>\n<th align=\"center\">扩容倍数</th>\n<th align=\"center\">初始容量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TypeScript <code>Array</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">≈ 2（V8 引擎）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java <code>ArrayList</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">1.5</td>\n<td align=\"center\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C++ <code>std::vector</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">2（常见实现）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"均摊分析-amortized-analysis\">均摊分析（Amortized Analysis）</h3><p>虽然单次扩容的拷贝代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但扩容并不会每次 <code>append</code> 都发生。假设初始容量为 1，倍增策略下，执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次 <code>append</code> 的总拷贝次数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + 2 + 4 + 8 + \\cdots + n = 2n - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因此总代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，平均到每次操作的均摊代价为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{O(n)}{n} = O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是为什么我们说动态数组末尾追加的时间复杂度是<strong>均摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实际语言中的动态数组\">实际语言中的动态数组</h2><h3 id=\"typescript-array\">TypeScript — Array</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const lst: number[] = [];&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; 20; i++) {&#10;  lst.push(i);&#10;  console.log(`长度: ${lst.length}, 元素: [${lst}]`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`长度: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lst</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, 元素: [${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lst</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}]`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TypeScript/JavaScript 的 <code>Array</code> 在 V8 引擎中根据元素类型和密度自动选择底层表示（SMI packed、double packed、holey 等）。扩容策略约为 2 倍增长，小数组增长更快。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对比其他语言\">对比其他语言</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>动态数组类型</th>\n<th>底层实现</th>\n<th>扩容策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TypeScript/JS</td>\n<td><code>Array</code></td>\n<td>V8 自适应（packed/holey）</td>\n<td>≈ 2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td><code>std::vector</code></td>\n<td>连续内存块</td>\n<td>2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td><code>ArrayList</code></td>\n<td><code>Object[]</code></td>\n<td>1.5 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>连续内存块</td>\n<td>2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"使用场景与选型建议\">使用场景与选型建议</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q1{&quot;Need frequent random access by index?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|Yes| A1[&quot;✅ Use Array / Dynamic Array&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|No| Q2{&quot;Need frequent insert/delete at head/middle?&quot;}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|Yes| A2[&quot;✅ Consider Linked List&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|No| Q3{&quot;Is the element count fixed?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|Yes| A3[&quot;✅ Use Static Array&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|No| A4[&quot;✅ Use Dynamic Array&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q1{\"Need frequent random access by index?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|Yes| A1[\"✅ Use Array / Dynamic Array\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|No| Q2{\"Need frequent insert/delete at head/middle?\"}\n    Q2 --&gt;|Yes| A2[\"✅ Consider Linked List\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|No| Q3{\"Is the element count fixed?\"}\n    Q3 --&gt;|Yes| A3[\"✅ Use Static Array\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|No| A4[\"✅ Use Dynamic Array\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>优先选择数组</strong>：当需要高频随机访问、数据量已知或仅在末尾增删时。</li>\n<li><strong>避免使用数组</strong>：当需要频繁在头部或中间位置执行插入/删除操作时（此时链表更合适）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"经典应用\">经典应用</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>前缀和数组</strong> —— 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 预处理，实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 区间求和查询。</li>\n<li><strong>双指针技巧</strong> —— 在有序数组上使用左右指针解决两数之和等问题。</li>\n<li><strong>滑动窗口</strong> —— 基于数组下标维护一个可变长度的窗口区间。</li>\n<li><strong>二分查找</strong> —— 数组有序时，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随机访问实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log\\,n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查找。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数组是最基础的数据结构，核心优势在于<strong>连续内存布局</strong>带来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随机访问能力。</li>\n<li>静态数组长度固定，动态数组通过<strong>倍增扩容</strong>策略实现灵活增长，末尾追加的均摊复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>数组的劣势在于中间位置的插入和删除代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，因为需要移动元素来维护连续性。</li>\n<li>理解数组的内存模型与复杂度特性，是掌握更高级数据结构（如哈希表、堆、线段树等）的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数组与动态数组","id":"数组与动态数组"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"静态数组 vs 动态数组","id":"静态数组-vs-动态数组"},{"level":3,"text":"静态数组","id":"静态数组"},{"level":3,"text":"动态数组","id":"动态数组"},{"level":2,"text":"核心操作与时间复杂度","id":"核心操作与时间复杂度"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么插入和删除是 O(n)？","id":"为什么插入和删除是-o-n"},{"level":2,"text":"动态数组扩容策略与均摊分析","id":"动态数组扩容策略与均摊分析"},{"level":3,"text":"倍增策略","id":"倍增策略"},{"level":3,"text":"均摊分析（Amortized Analysis）","id":"均摊分析-amortized-analysis"},{"level":2,"text":"实际语言中的动态数组","id":"实际语言中的动态数组"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript — Array","id":"typescript-array"},{"level":3,"text":"对比其他语言","id":"对比其他语言"},{"level":2,"text":"使用场景与选型建议","id":"使用场景与选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"经典应用","id":"经典应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大O表示法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-structures/fundamentals/big-o-notation"},"next":{"title":"链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-structures/linear-structures/linked-lists"}}